    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funi raccoon Game, a 3D Platformer Collectathon. You play as a raccoon who has recently acquired a new home (Dumpster).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.poster.avif?t=1749719355\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.webm?t=1749719355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/c16ada8c79a880e845e7ed5f5b3b4e44.mp4?t=1749719355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home is where the stuff is, but your home is pretty empty. Fill up your dumpster with cool, unique stuff.  The more stuff you have, the more places you can go! Travel the lands, &quot;help&quot; the locals, and solve puzzles -- <i><strong>all in the aim to get more stuff!?!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES AND MECHANICS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/8f608453f0f10eb5d1ab94dfcef1018e.poster.avif?t=1749719355\" width=641 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/8f608453f0f10eb5d1ab94dfcef1018e.webm?t=1749719355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/3fcf1ebca1f84f2f68f234dd86b41943.avif?t=1749719355\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Pick Up</strong></i></u> and <u><i><strong>Throw Stuff</strong></i></u>:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use that stuff for problem solving:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > reaching previously unreachable area: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple traversal possibilities for those willing to steal the keys of opportunity:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to various micro worlds all interconnected in whimsical ways:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.poster.avif?t=1749719355\" width=620 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.webm?t=1749719355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599690/extras/07941265bae3e6cf0180d1a7c6070d52.mp4?t=1749719355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hi o/</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
